Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:03:13.86,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:03:13.86,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}高芙 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}2 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 佩古拉 · 赛后捧杯致辞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:04.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, first I want to say congrats to Coco
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:04.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先我想恭喜高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:05.88,EN,,0,0,0,,and her team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:05.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,和她的团队。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:09.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Gosh, you were like a backboard today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:09.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,天呐，你就是一堵回球墙。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.24,0:00:10.64,EN,,0,0,0,,It was not fun to play against.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.24,0:00:10.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,打你真的很难受。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.64,0:00:12.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I didn't even think I played bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.64,0:00:12.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我都不觉得自己打得差，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.12,0:00:13.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I just think you played
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.12,0:00:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,只是觉得你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:14.20,EN,,0,0,0,,a really, really high level.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:14.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,发挥得实在太出色了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:15.64,EN,,0,0,0,,So, congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:15.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以，恭喜你。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:17.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:17.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,呃，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:20.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Amazing momentum headed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:20.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,士气这么好，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:21.88,EN,,0,0,0,,into the US Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:21.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,正好冲着美网去。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.88,0:00:23.84,EN,,0,0,0,,And obviously, I mean, we know each other
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.88,0:00:23.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且，我们彼此太了解了，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:24.96,EN,,0,0,0,,so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:24.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,太熟悉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:28.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I I I can't really see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:28.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我都看不清你人在哪儿。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:29.16,EN,,0,0,0,,We know each other so well,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:29.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们真的太了解彼此，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.16,0:00:30.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and I have so much respect for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.16,0:00:30.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且我非常尊敬你。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:33.68,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I just enjoy being able to share the court
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:33.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,能和你同场竞技，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:34.48,EN,,0,0,0,,with you, practice with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:34.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,一起训练，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:35.72,EN,,0,0,0,,be at these tournaments with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:35.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,一起打这些赛事，我很享受。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:37.68,EN,,0,0,0,,For when you first came on tour,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:37.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,从你刚上巡回赛那会儿起，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:40.04,EN,,0,0,0,,it's it's been a wild ride, at least
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:40.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,这段旅程一直很疯狂，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:41.72,EN,,0,0,0,,for the amount that I have seen you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:41.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,至少我看着你走过来是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:42.84,EN,,0,0,0,,So, it's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:42.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的很了不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:43.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Congrats to you and your team,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:43.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你和你的团队，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.96,0:00:46.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and all the best going forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.96,0:00:46.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝你未来一切顺利。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.12,0:00:49.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.12,0:00:49.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:54.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm a little upset I have two of these now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:54.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我现在有点郁闷，第二次了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.64,0:00:57.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I wanted the bigger one, but that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.64,0:00:57.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想要更大的那个，没事。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.12,0:00:59.24,EN,,0,0,0,,It's still a pretty trophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.12,0:00:59.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个也很漂亮。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.24,0:01:00.68,EN,,0,0,0,,And next I want to thank
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.24,0:01:00.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,接下来我想谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.68,0:01:02.64,EN,,0,0,0,,my team that's here with me this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.68,0:01:02.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,这周一直陪着我的团队。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.64,0:01:04.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Mark Knowles, Spencer,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.64,0:01:04.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,马克·诺尔斯、斯宾塞，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:06.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Seba, thank you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:06.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有塞巴，谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.32,0:01:08.76,EN,,0,0,0,,for supporting me this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.32,0:01:08.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一周的支持。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.76,0:01:12.92,EN,,0,0,0,,We had a fun 12 days, or however long
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.76,0:01:12.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,这十二天，或者说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.92,0:01:14.16,EN,,0,0,0,,it's been, a couple weeks together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.92,0:01:14.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,这几周我们相处，很开心。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.16,0:01:15.88,EN,,0,0,0,,So, it's been a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.16,0:01:15.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的很有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:17.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I think I've stressed you guys out a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:17.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,这几场比赛我肯定没少让你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.80,0:01:19.16,EN,,0,0,0,,over the last few matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.80,0:01:19.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,操心。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:21.48,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thanks for sticking it with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:21.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们一直陪着我扛过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.48,0:01:23.08,EN,,0,0,0,,And to Mark and John,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.48,0:01:23.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有马克和约翰，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:25.00,EN,,0,0,0,,my other coach and my trainer back home,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:25.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我另一位教练和体能师，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:27.84,EN,,0,0,0,,my husband, my family, my dogs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:27.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的丈夫、家人和狗狗们，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:29.68,EN,,0,0,0,,that were actually here for a brief period
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:29.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,它们也来过这儿一小段时间，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.68,0:01:30.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and got to support me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.68,0:01:30.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,陪我加油。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:32.52,EN,,0,0,0,,But, thanks to everyone back home that's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:32.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,也谢谢家里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.52,0:01:33.72,EN,,0,0,0,,been cheering me on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.52,0:01:33.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直为我加油的每一个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:35.56,EN,,0,0,0,,It's been an awesome 2 weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:35.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,这两周真的很棒，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.56,0:01:39.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and an honor to be back in the final here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.56,0:01:39.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,能再打进决赛，是种荣幸。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.12,0:01:45.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Next, I want to thank thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.12,0:01:45.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,接下来我想谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.52,0:01:47.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to Credit One, to Kelly and Ben Navarro.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.52,0:01:47.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢 Credit One、凯莉和本。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.64,0:01:50.04,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys have been so so great to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.64,0:01:50.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们对我一直特别好，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:51.80,EN,,0,0,0,,not only here, but also in Charleston
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:51.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,不只是在这儿，在查尔斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:52.92,EN,,0,0,0,,when I come to play your event.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:52.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我去打你们那站比赛也一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:54.44,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you guys for just investing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:54.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.32,EN,,0,0,0,,so much into tennis and growing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,在网球上投入这么多，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.32,0:01:57.64,EN,,0,0,0,,this sport everywhere throughout
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.32,0:01:57.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,把这项运动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.64,0:01:58.32,EN,,0,0,0,,the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.64,0:01:58.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,带到全国各地。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.32,0:01:59.40,EN,,0,0,0,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.32,0:01:59.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的很了不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:01.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:01.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢鲍勃。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.48,0:02:04.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I I think we all love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.48,0:02:04.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们都特别喜欢你。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:06.44,EN,,0,0,0,,So, like, you're awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:06.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你真的很棒。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.44,0:02:08.52,EN,,0,0,0,,All the players love being around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.44,0:02:08.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有球员都喜欢有你在身边。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:09.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Thanks for getting me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:09.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.36,0:02:11.04,EN,,0,0,0,,an espresso last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.36,0:02:11.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,临时给我弄了一杯浓缩咖啡。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.04,0:02:12.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I needed another one,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.04,0:02:12.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我确实还需要再来一杯，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:14.48,EN,,0,0,0,,but it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:14.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过没关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.48,0:02:17.20,EN,,0,0,0,,And thanks Pam and everyone out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.48,0:02:17.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,也谢谢帕姆和所有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:19.68,EN,,0,0,0,,that puts on this event, the volunteers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,为这场赛事付出的志愿者。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.68,0:02:20.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.68,0:02:20.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,说真的，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:22.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I think the volunteers here are so nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:22.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,这儿的志愿者都特别好，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:25.16,EN,,0,0,0,,all the workers, everyone from the ball kids
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:25.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有工作人员，从捡球的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:26.88,EN,,0,0,0,,to the people checking our badges
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:26.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,到检查我们证件的人，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:29.04,EN,,0,0,0,,and getting the cars and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:29.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有安排用车的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:33.08,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:33.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们都太棒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.04,0:02:38.44,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah, it makes it so much fun
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.04,0:02:38.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,这让打球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.44,0:02:39.36,EN,,0,0,0,,to play here, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.44,0:02:39.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这儿打球很有意思，真的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:41.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I do I love playing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:41.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是真的很喜欢在这儿打球。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.00,0:02:43.48,EN,,0,0,0,,It's just It's such a cozy kind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.00,0:02:43.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里有一种
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.48,0:02:45.80,EN,,0,0,0,,of warm-hearted feeling playing tennis here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.48,0:02:45.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,很温馨的感觉，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.80,0:02:47.16,EN,,0,0,0,,in Cincinnati, so I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.80,0:02:47.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,在辛辛那提打球我很喜欢。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:48.48,EN,,0,0,0,,And last but not least, thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:48.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后同样重要的是，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:50.72,EN,,0,0,0,,so much to the fans that come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:50.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有到场的球迷。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.72,0:02:52.84,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys are some of the best best fans
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.72,0:02:52.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们是我们遇到过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.84,0:02:56.12,EN,,0,0,0,,that we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.84,0:02:56.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,最好的球迷之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.84,0:02:59.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Truly, you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.84,0:02:59.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,真心的，你们真的是。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:01.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I I think I sign more autographs here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:01.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我在这儿签的名
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.40,0:03:02.76,EN,,0,0,0,,than anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.40,0:03:02.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,比其他任何地方都多。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.76,0:03:05.68,EN,,0,0,0,,So, it's it's a lot of fun for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.76,0:03:05.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,这对我们来说真的很有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.68,0:03:07.44,EN,,0,0,0,,And just thank you so much for coming out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.68,0:03:07.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:08.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and supporting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:08.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,到场支持我们。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:11.72,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:11.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.36,0:03:13.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Let's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.36,0:03:13.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们……
